ly type the text displayed on screen to block her attack.<br>* If you get hit you'll loose life and die. You will also loose Sanity, causing a confusion effect on your camera. <br>* Hide in the bathroom to get some peace and sanity back !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/05e7b1088ca1db5b7366f30a15c04ac0.avif?t=1657291519\" width=600 height=360 /></span><br>* Drink wine to heal, because isn't it happy hour anytime ? But not too much... or you'll fall when you try to sprint ! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/506b339985dbc2511a3071911a24472e.avif?t=1657291519\" width=600 height=360 /></span><br><br>* Once you found all the evidences, you will have to find some specific objects in your house. <br>* Lastly escape the map by going to your car ! <br><br><strong>Will you find all the evidences and leave the house before loosing your mind... or worst... that she kills you?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/17ff6805ce27b72d0847d0973d523797.avif?t=1657291519\" width=634 height=116 /></span><br><br>* Your agent is coming soon to sign your new movie contract ! But your Ex-Wife decided to make a mess <br>* Run after her and clean the army of turd that come out from her body  (how does she do that?!)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/307acdebae6d6bc5f7d4349630e899fa.avif?t=1657291519\" width=600 height=360 /></span><br>* You can make her busy by calling her at some specific location, giving you time to find &amp; clean the turds<br>* You have one mop for the floor and another tool for the walls (Left click / Right Click)<br><br><span cla